    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Starts from [0, 1] and repeatedly removes the open middle third of every remaining interval. After n steps there are 2^n intervals of total length (2/3)^n \to 0, yet the limit set is uncountable. Box counting recovers its fractional dimension \log 2/\log 3 \approx 0.631.">

